classDiagram
%% ===================================================================
%% CLASS DIAGRAM (VOPC) - PHA PHAN TICH: CHUC NANG SUA COMBO
%% ===================================================================

class QuanLy {
    <<actor>>
}

class MenuUI {
    <<boundary>>
    monDangChon
    danhSachMonHienThi
}

class MenuController {
    <<control>>
}

class MenuItem {
    <<abstract>>
    <<entity>>
    maMon
    tenMon
    gia
    dangKinhDoanh
}

class Dish {
    <<entity>>
    loaiMon
    moTa
}

class Combo {
    <<entity>>
    soLuongNguoiAn
}

class ComboDetail {
    <<entity>>
    soLuong
    ghiChu
}

QuanLy --> MenuUI : chon va sua combo
MenuUI --> MenuController : gui thong tin cap nhat
MenuController --> Combo : cap nhat combo
MenuController --> ComboDetail : them/sua/xoa chi tiet
MenuItem <|-- Dish : la mot
MenuItem <|-- Combo : la mot
Combo "1" *-- "1..*" ComboDetail : gom
ComboDetail "*" --> "1" Dish : chua mon le
